### 1. Создание подписки на SPOT сделки BTC-USDT
POST http://localhost:5556/api/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exchange": "KUCOIN",
  "market": "SPOT",
  "symbol": "BTC-USDT",
  "command": {
    "type": "trades"
  }
}

### 2. Создание подписки на FUTURES сделки ETH-USDT
POST http://localhost:5556/api/subscriptions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exchange": "KUCOIN",
  "market": "FUTURES",
  "symbol": "ETH-USDT",
  "command": {
    "type": "trades"
  }
}

### 3. Получение списка всех активных подписок
GET http://localhost:5556/api/subscriptions
Accept: application/json

### 4. Отписка по ID (замените 1 на актуальный ID)
DELETE http://localhost:5556/api/subscriptions/1
